  "适合控制电脑：\n• 单指滑动：移动鼠标\n• 单击：左键\n• 轻点一次，第二次按住并移动：拖拽，松手结束\n• 长按或双指轻点：右键\n• 双指平行滑动：滚动\n• 双指捏合：缩放画面\n• 虚拟鼠标：左右键、中键和滚轮与实体鼠标一致，按住鼠标拖动区即可移动远端指针\n• 虚拟鼠标开启且画面放大后：单指拖动画面其他区域直接平移视野\n• 边缘跟随开启后：手机/平板放大画面，手指移动鼠标到可视区域中心附近，视野立即跟随；停手即停，抬手再滑无需等待\n• 虚拟鼠标拖动区同样支持中心跟随；到达远端桌面边界后，鼠标继续移动\n• 实体鼠标：靠近画面边缘并短暂停留后自动平移，越靠边越快\n• 全屏三指上滑：调出系统键盘，输入直达远端": "For computers:\n• One-finger swipe: move cursor\n• Tap: left click\n• Tap, then hold the second tap and move: drag; release to finish\n• Long press or two-finger tap: right click\n• Two parallel fingers: scroll\n• Pinch: zoom\n• Virtual mouse: left/right/middle buttons and wheel; hold its drag area to move the cursor\n• With virtual mouse enabled and zoomed: drag elsewhere to pan\n• With tracking enabled: move the cursor near the view center to pan immediately; stop to pause; subsequent swipes need no waiting\n• Virtual mouse dragging also supports center tracking\n• Physical mouse: hover briefly near an edge to pan; closer means faster\n• Three-finger swipe up in full screen: open local keyboard and type remotely",
  "适合直接点按：\n• 点按位置：左键\n• 按住移动：拖拽\n• 双指轻点：右键\n• 双指平行滑动：滚动\n• 双指捏合：缩放画面\n• 放大后点“移动画面”：按钮变为淡蓝色，单指平移视野且不点击远端\n• 移动画面模式下，双指滚动和捏合缩放仍可使用\n• 全屏三指上滑：调出系统键盘，输入直达远端": "For direct touch:\n• Tap position: left click\n• Hold and move: drag\n• Two-finger tap: right click\n• Two parallel fingers: scroll\n• Pinch: zoom\n• When zoomed, select Pan view (light blue) to pan with one finger without clicking remotely\n• Two-finger scrolling and pinch zoom remain available while panning\n• Three-finger swipe up in full screen: open local keyboard and type remotely",
  "手机 / 平板单独投屏": "Phone / tablet app-only projection",
  "先通过系统控制中心连接无线投屏，再打开顶部投屏胶囊，按系统提示将 StarRustDesk 单独投屏。是否提供该入口取决于设备、系统版本和接收端。\n在“控 → 画面 → 屏幕方向”中开启“跟随系统旋转”时遵循系统旋转锁；关闭后可选择自动旋转、固定竖屏或固定横屏。开关和独立方向都保存在本机，重启 App 后仍有效；退出远控恢复原方向。\n单独投屏时方向仍独立设置：默认适配横向外接屏，也可手动固定竖屏或横屏；返回手机后恢复本屏策略。这里只调整本地窗口，不更改远端分辨率。": "Connect wireless projection in Control Center, then use the projection capsule to project StarRustDesk separately. Availability depends on the device, OS and receiver.\nUnder Controls > View > Screen orientation, Follow system rotation respects the system rotation lock. Turn it off to choose Auto rotate, Lock portrait or Lock landscape. Both the switch and independent orientation are saved locally and retained after restarting the app. Leaving remote control restores the original orientation.\nProjection keeps a separate policy: landscape external screens are fitted automatically, or you can lock portrait/landscape manually. Returning to the phone restores its local policy. This changes only the local window, not remote resolution.",
  "拖拽与框选": "Drag and select",
  "鼠标模式：先将远端指针移到起点，轻点一次，第二次按住并拖动，松手结束。框选文件时请从文件列表或桌面的空白处开始；从文件上开始通常是拖动文件。\n触摸模式：在目标位置按住并移动，松手结束。": "Mouse mode: move the cursor to the start, tap once, then hold the second tap and drag. Release to finish. To box-select files, start on empty space; starting on a file usually drags it.\nTouch mode: hold at the target and move; release to finish.",
  "组合键与本地键盘": "Shortcuts and local keyboard",
  "连接后默认显示折叠的“键”按钮，点击展开；“键”和“控”及其拖动柄均可移动到屏幕任意位置。\n横屏时“键”默认位于左上角，“控”默认位于右上角，两个面板都向下展开。长按任意功能按钮可调整排序。\nCtrl、Alt、Shift、Win/Cmd：点一下选中，相当于按住；再点一下释放，不需要手指一直按着。可以同时选中多个。\n例如 Ctrl+C：点亮 Ctrl，再输入 C，最后再次点击 Ctrl 取消选中。Mac 常用 Cmd+C。Ctrl/Shift 也可配合鼠标多选文件，用完记得释放。\nCtrl+Shift+Esc 等完整组合键按钮：点一次发送整组按键，不会自动弹出本地键盘。\n打开软键盘时保留画面当前比例，按可见区域上移，不会整体缩小。": "A collapsed Keys button appears after connecting. Tap to expand. Keys, Controls and their handles can be moved anywhere.\nIn landscape, Keys defaults to the top left and Controls to the top right. Both expand downward. Hold a button to reorder it.\nTap Ctrl, Alt, Shift or Win/Cmd to hold it; tap again to release. Several modifiers can be selected together.\nFor Ctrl+C, select Ctrl, type C, then release Ctrl. Macs usually use Cmd+C. Ctrl/Shift also work with mouse selection; release them afterwards.\nFull shortcuts such as Ctrl+Shift+Esc send all keys with one tap without opening the local keyboard.\nOpening the soft keyboard preserves the current view scale and shifts it into the visible area without shrinking the whole desktop.",
  "连续输入与键盘悬浮按钮": "Continuous input and floating keyboard button",
  "手机和平板连接后显示独立键盘悬浮按钮，不用展开“控”；可拖到顺手的位置。点一下打开本地键盘，再点一下收起。\n键盘开启后可继续点击远端其他输入框，输入仍直接传给远端，不因点按画面而收起；点击收起按钮、系统返回或输入法收起即可结束。\n全屏三指上滑仍可打开键盘。实体键盘和完整组合键不会自动唤起软键盘。远端输入框没有可靠的焦点通知，需要用户主动打开键盘。": "Phones and tablets show a separate floating keyboard button after connecting. No need to expand Controls; drag it to a convenient position. Tap to open the local keyboard, and tap again to hide it.\nWhile the keyboard is open, you can click other remote fields and keep typing directly on the remote device. Tapping the desktop does not close it. Use the keyboard button, system Back or the input method's hide action to end input.\nA three-finger swipe up in full screen still opens the keyboard. Physical keys and preset shortcuts do not open the soft keyboard automatically. Remote fields do not provide reliable focus notifications; open the keyboard explicitly.",
  "自定义实体键盘映射": "Custom physical keyboard mapping",
  "在“控 → 输入 → 键盘设置”中打开“自定义键盘映射”。默认关闭，按服务器和远端分别保存。\n可选择或录入源按键，再选择目标按键；首版支持修饰键、F1–F12、方向及编辑键。选中修饰键可让一个普通按键发送一次完整组合键，长按不重复触发组合键。\nMac 预设包括 Ctrl→Command、Ctrl 与 Win/Cmd 互换、F3→Ctrl+↑。选择预设只替换草稿规则，不会自动启用；点击保存后生效，取消不改变现有设置。\n仅映射实际转发的实体按键；中文输入、粘贴和快捷栏按钮保持原意。Fn 等被系统或键盘硬件处理的按键可能无法录入。": "Open Custom keyboard mapping under Controls > Input > Keyboard settings. It is off by default and saved separately for each server and remote device.\nChoose or capture a source key, then choose a target key. This version supports modifiers, F1-F12, navigation and editing keys. Selecting modifiers makes a non-modifier source key send one complete shortcut, without repeating it while held.\nMac presets include Ctrl to Command, swapping Ctrl and Win/Cmd, and F3 to Ctrl+Up. Presets replace draft rules without enabling mapping automatically. Save applies changes; Cancel keeps existing settings.\nOnly physical keys forwarded to the remote device are mapped. Chinese text, pasted content and shortcut-bar buttons are unchanged. Keys such as Fn may be handled by the system or keyboard hardware and may not be capturable.",
  "实体键盘布局与校准": "Physical keyboard layout and calibration",
  "在“控 → 输入 → 键盘设置”中选择键盘布局。自动只恢复已校准的键盘；系统原样不应用布局校准。\n苹果键盘的 Command / Option 对不上时，选择“苹果布局修正 → 校准 Command / Option”，依提示分别按下并松开左侧两个按键，再保存。\n稳定识别的键盘会记住校准；无法稳定识别时仅用于本次会话。多个键盘同时连接时暂停布局修正。更改键盘硬件的 Mac / PC 模式后需重新校准。\n布局只修正实体修饰键，自定义映射中明确设置的对应键优先；中文输入、粘贴和快捷栏保持原意。": "Choose a keyboard layout under Controls > Input > Keyboard settings. Auto restores only confirmed calibrations; System layout ignores layout calibration.\nIf the Apple keyboard's Command and Option keys are swapped, select Apple layout correction > Calibrate Command / Option. Press and release each left modifier as instructed, then save.\nReliably identified keyboards remember calibration; unidentified keyboards use it for this session only. Correction pauses when multiple keyboards are connected. Recalibrate after changing the keyboard's hardware Mac/PC mode.\nOnly physical modifiers are corrected. Explicit custom rules take priority. Chinese text, pasted content and shortcut-bar buttons are unchanged.",
  "悬浮功能栏与移动画面": "Floating controls and panning",
  "竖屏时“控”保持底部横向工具栏；横屏时默认移动到右上角并向下展开。点击收起后保留“控”按钮。\n未开启虚拟鼠标时，画面放大后可使用“移动画面”模式；开启虚拟鼠标后，直接单指拖动画面空白区域即可平移，鼠标本体专门控制远端指针。\n全屏三指上滑用于打开本地键盘，不是滚动手势；滚动请使用双指平行滑动。": "Controls use a bottom horizontal bar in portrait and expand down from the top right in landscape. Collapsing keeps the Controls button.\nWithout the virtual mouse, use Pan view after zooming. With it enabled, drag elsewhere with one finger to pan; the mouse itself moves the remote pointer.\nSwipe up with three fingers in full screen to open the keyboard. Use two parallel fingers to scroll.",
